# Stem 7 Regular: glyph source.
# Format: tools/s7lib/source.py (and README.md). One block per glyph, blank line between blocks.
# 9 rows per glyph: rows 1-7 above the baseline (cap line, x-height on row 4), rows 8-9 descender.
# X = ink, . = paper. Side bearings default to lsb=0 rsb=1 (whole cells).
# The mark and the pantry glyphs are read from house.json (from=...): edit them there, never here.

glyph space U+0020,U+00A0 width=3

glyph figurespace U+2007 width=6

